2026-02-17 14:32:57,783 INFO ipython import frappe
2026-02-17 14:32:57,783 INFO ipython import json
2026-02-17 14:32:57,783 INFO ipython settings = frappe.get_single("Vooroo CRM Settings")
2026-02-17 14:32:57,784 INFO ipython stages_json = settings.get("deal_pipeline_stages")
2026-02-17 14:32:57,784 INFO ipython stages = json.loads(stages_json) if isinstance(stages_json, str) else stages_json
2026-02-17 14:32:57,784 INFO ipython # Check for lost status
2026-02-17 14:32:57,785 INFO ipython has_lost = any(s.get('status') == 'lost' for s in stages)
